WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.972
Buying a dehumidifier in Germany? Twenty litres is not a

00:00:03.972 --> 00:00:05.783
promise for your cold cellar.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.824
Open the comparison without a questionnaire. Check the exact model

00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:11.300
and the measurement conditions.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.349
This is the Meaco Dry Arete One, twenty litre model.

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:16.828
Open its official source.

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:21.221
At ten degrees Celsius and sixty percent humidity, the manufacturer

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.051
lists three point four litres per day.

00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:28.107
At twenty degrees with the same humidity, it lists eight

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:29.219
point five litres.

00:00:29.569 --> 00:00:33.734
These are manufacturer figures, not our product test. The other

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:36.233
model lacks matching verified figures here.

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:40.511
Missing data stays unknown. This comparison does not establish an

00:00:40.511 --> 00:00:41.297
efficiency winner.

00:00:41.647 --> 00:00:45.277
Open the German dehumidifier guide at get eco back dot

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:47.092
com. Choose the direct comparison.
